      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SessionWindowCollection<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SessionWindowCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Transforms a collection into an enumerable collection of session windows and manages\neviction of old items from the source collection.\nThis wrapper can be used to manage the retention policy of the underlying\ncollection. Objects added through this wrapper are inserted in chronological\norder and evicted according to the policy provided to the constructor.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SlidingWindowCollection-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SlidingWindowCollection-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SlidingWindowCollection<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.SlidingWindowCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Transforms a collection into an enumerable collection of overlapping time windows and manages\neviction of old items from the source collection.\nThis wrapper can be used to manage the retention policy of the underlying collection.\nObjects added through this wrapper are inserted in chronological\norder and evicted according to the <code>startTime</code> policy provided to the constructor.</p>\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "ManagedReference",
      "source_relative_path": "api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.TumblingWindowCollection-1.yml",
      "output": {
        ".html": {
          "relative_path": "api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.TumblingWindowCollection-1.html"
        }
      },
      "version": "",
      "Uid": null,
      "IsMRef": true,
      "Title": "Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.TumblingWindowCollection<T>",
      "Summary": "<p sourcefile=\"api/Scaleout.Streaming.TimeWindowing.TumblingWindowCollection-1.yml\" sourcestartlinenumber=\"1\">Transforms a collection into an enumerable collection of fixed-time windows and manages\neviction of old items from the source collection.\nThis wrapper can be used to manage the retention policy of the underlying collection.\nObjects added through this wrapper are inserted in chronological\norder and evicted according to the <code>startTime</code> policy provided to the constructor.</p>\n"
    },
